<li>The thirteen items on <code>main</code>: commit <a href="https://github.com/palimondo/fortress/commit/9311b09678b3fc89cac8f989e064d750b587613c"><code>9311b0967</code></a>. The cold read's fixes: the branch <a href="https://github.com/palimondo/fortress/tree/skill/coordinator-cold-read-fixes"><code>skill/coordinator-cold-read-fixes</code></a>, commit <a href="https://github.com/palimondo/fortress/commit/10532a220a07e0579f947f819c22926c04c74d1e"><code>10532a220</code></a>.</li>
</ul>
